# The Sephiroth, One-Winged Angel emblem's "whenever a creature dies" looks back to the board as it was before the event
# (CR 603.10a), like any dies ability, though the emblem itself is in the command zone (CR 114.4): a creature dying at the
# same time as Hushbringer, Hushbringer included, doesn't cause it to trigger (Hushbringer's rulings). Sephiroth's own game
# to his transformation (four deaths to one Pyroclasm on turn 3: 16 and 24, the emblem made as he transforms). Bot2 makes
# an Ornithopter and casts Hushbringer on turn 4; on turn 5 Bot1 makes one and casts a second Pyroclasm: Hushbringer and
# both Ornithopters die at once, and the emblem drains for none of them: 16 and 24 still.

